WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.210
Paver brings construction projects and site operations into one
workspace. The dashboard shows active jobs and what needs
attention.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:17.090
Open Projects to review each site, its client, progress, and
delivery date, without jumping between separate lists.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:24.530
Use purchasing and inventory to follow materials, from the
warehouse to project sites, and see what is available.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:33.130
Keep people and records connected. Review staff payments and
financial transactions, so your team can trace each entry.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:43.170
Compare project costs with budgets and keep supporting records
close. Projects, materials, people, and finances, together with
Paver.
